[chorus, choir]
ozzi: "Prince of patch bays, turn up the coil!" = chorus ; do cheer ; jump 1.5 ; cam low-angle
  + watt @3: "Turn up the coil!" = 3 2/.5 0/.5 2/2.6 ; jump 1.5
