gruff: "Hear it boil!" = -2/.4 0/.4 -2/.8 | I 2 ; dance 4
watt: "All six sockets light in the dark!" = 0 2 3/.5 4/.5 2 1/.5 0/.5 1/2.6 | VI 4, V 4 ; do nod ; move wide-left 4 ; cam reaction
ozzi: "Ride the green wave, catch ev'ry spark!" = chorus ; do laugh ; move center 4 ; cam wide

[patchbay bridge]
watt: "Yellow plug jumps to slot number three!" = 0/.5 2/.5 3 4/.5 3/.5 2 0/.5 -2/.5 1/2.6 | IV 4, II 4 ; do gasp ; move center 4 ; jump 1.5 ; cam two-shot
gruff: "Watch those patch cords wrap right past me!" = -2 0/.5 2/.5 3 2 1/.5 -1/.5 4/2.6 | VI 4, V 4 ; do shrug ; move left 4 ; cam reaction
